00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.390
Hello, hello!

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:21.310
It's Charatomi from the Charatomi Channel!

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:28.030
Let's see what happens if I ignore traffic
signals in the Shibuya scramble crosswalk!

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.740
Please subscribe to my channel!

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:36.080
Watch it! What are you doing?!

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.580
Idiot! I'm in a hurry here!

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:45.750
You're all side characters!
I'm the main character!

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.360
CHAPTER 1

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:52.200
THE DAY YOKAI AWOKE

00:03:55.950 --> 00:04:01.330
<i>Yesterday, at 3:20 PM, a giant forest
suddenly appeared in Shibuya.</i>

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:07.340
<i>Witnesses say people suddenly turned into
trees, but we have no clear information.</i>

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:13.220
<i>It seems people really turned into trees,
but what is your professional opinion?</i>

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:15.220
It could be a chemical weapon.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.260
It must be aliens!

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:20.520
It's likely a genetic abnormality
caused by toxins.

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:23.790
No it's not! It's because of <i>yokai</i>!

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:29.820
Stop lying about the forest in Shibuya
being because of <i>yokai</i>.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:32.460
There's no such thing as <i>yokai</i>.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.550
I'm not lying.

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:37.570
You two brothers.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.930
Are you bullying him again?

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.890
Oh crap, it's Big Mana!

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:47.060
Show some respect!

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:48.090
Souma!

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.590
Why me?

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:52.800
And I'm not that big... I don't think.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:55.530
Th-This is none of your business!

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:57.220
Yes it is.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.010
He's my neighbor.

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:01.040
Mana-chan.

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:03.350
Are you okay? What's wrong?

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:05.960
My grandma told me.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:10.650
A <i>yokai</i> that turned people to trees
was sealed away centuries ago.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:13.210
It must have returned.

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:17.660
There's no such thing as <i>yokai</i>, dummy!

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:20.120
Yes there are! We just can't see them!

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.180
Then show us.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.830
My grandma said so!

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:29.540
She said if you put a letter
in the Yokai Mailbox he'll come.

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:31.670
Who?

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.360
Kitaro.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:34.610
Kitaro?

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:35.860
What the heck?

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:38.720
Kitaro vanquishes <i>yokai</i>!

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.760
Then try calling him.

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:44.560
Do you even know where this
Yokai Mailbox is?

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:46.750
No, I don't.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.150
See? I knew it was a lie.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:53.360
Then I'll look for it for you.

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:56.220
It's best to ask this sort of thing
on the internet.

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:02.240
<i>I doubt anyone's going to answer, though.</i>

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.500
Someone did...

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:09.500
<i>dog_mana-san's Question
Q: Where is the Yokai Mailbox?</i>

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.730
<i>nya3_neko-san's Response</i>

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.050
Here we are.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.780
That must be it!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:25.770
So, you put a letter in that?

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:26.730
Yeah.

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:31.080
Then Kitaro will come with a "clop-clop".

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.090
What do you mean, "clop-clop"?

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:36.590
It's just "clop-clop"!
I'm not sure what that is.

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.420
Clop-clop-clop!

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:40.860
Souma!

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:42.740
I'll send a letter for you.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.100
So, why me?

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.040
<i>How do you write a letter again?</i>

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:50.920
"Dear Kitaro-san...

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:56.440
The town's people are being turned
into trees. Please help.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.220
Mana Inuyama."

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:02.800
Hey, Mana, are you serious?!

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.340
I put it in!

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:38.590
You're gonna be cursed!

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.030
What?!

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.870
That jerk! Where did he go?!

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:53.100
Thank you for believing me.

00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:00.210
It's not like I believed him.

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:04.870
There's no way <i>yokai</i> exist
in the 21st century.

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:10.180
<i>"A forest in Shibuya? LOL"</i>

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:32.830
Hey! Your kid brother was bullying
Yuta-kun again, wasn't he?!

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.520
It's not my business.

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:36.810
Yes it is! You're the older one!

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:55.670
Kitaro will come with a "clop-clop".

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.830
Wh-Who are you?!

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:19.570
I'm GeGeGe no Kitaro.

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.670
Are you Mami?

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:25.970
It's Mana! Mana Inuyama!

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.510
Are you the young miss
who sent us the letter?

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:37.170
Wh-What was that? A-A-A talking eyeball?!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.590
No way, no way! That's impossible!

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:45.110
Sorry to startle you. This is my dad.

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:48.640
No way, no way, no way! Impossible!

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:52.120
A dad who's just an eyeball can't be real!

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:54.730
Don't be so surprised.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:10:00.080
I'm Kitaro's father.
I'm called Daddy Eyeball.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.710
Hey, that tickles!

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:09.680
Real? A special effect? Or am I dreaming?

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:15.330
Young miss,
the world you see isn't all there is.

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.390
There is also a world you can't see.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:25.170
We received a letter saying people are
being turned into trees. Is that true?

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:26.800
Look at this.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.400
What's that?

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:30.780
It's a smartphone.

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:33.490
TVs have certainly gotten small.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:38.730
It's not a TV. You can make calls
and even see out of cameras in Shibuya.

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:43.500
Y-You can see Shibuya
from something this small?!

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:46.820
What a convenient age it's become.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:48.720
Just look!

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.840
Th-These are vampires!

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.330
Dracula?

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:56.560
Not that type. The tree kind.

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:58.020
Vampire Trees?

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:57.200
VAMPIRE

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:57.960
VAMPIRE TREE

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:01.790
Exactly. Trees that grow
off the nutrition of human blood.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.960
Why is something like that in Shibuya...

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.800
Wait, if you know,
then let's go to Shibuya!

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:12.800
They're Vampire Trees all right.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:20.290
But, Dad, wasn't the <i>yokai</i> that controls
Vampire Trees sealed away centuries ago?

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.650
Uh, Mana-chan was it?

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:25.750
That "smash" seems rather useful.

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:29.010
It's called a smartphone. Wanna try?

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.660
Swipe there.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.020
Oh, you swipe by dragging...

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:41.330
So, I do this here?

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:43.460
Kitaro, this is amazing!

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.940
It sure is, Dad.

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:48.960
Kitaro, this must be it.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:52.400
<i>Found a weird seal so I pulled it off!!!
by Charatomi</i>

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:59.580
Wheee! Waaay!

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.730
-<i>"Smash it!"</i>
-<i>"Yeah. LOL"</i>

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:03.540
<i>"It was him!"</i>

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:07.800
That fool!
He removed the seal of the Nobiagari!

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.030
The Nobiagari?

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:10.490
It's a <i>yokai</i>.

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:13.660
It plants Vampire Tree seeds in people.

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:16.030
That's what turned everyone into trees?

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:19.450
From here, it's our job. Go home.

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:22.710
Wait! I sent the letter!

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:24.690
I can come, can't I?

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:26.560
You'll be in danger.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:27.770
So?

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.230
I warned you once.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:32.280
I've been warned!

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.640
What is this place?

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:43.190
It looks like an underground reservoir
that stores rainwater from the city.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:46.480
You're human and you don't even know that?

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:47.900
I knew that!

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:52.970
Up ahead is where that fool removed
the Nobiagari's seal.

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:10.440
NOBIAGARI

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:13.150
That's the Nobiagari! I'm sure of it!

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.490
There's nothing there.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:43.600
Oh no! That's a Vampire Tree seed!

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.670
Get a grip, Kitaro!

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:52.270
Y-Yes.

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:54.300
Hey! Are you okay?!

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:59.490
Leave me... alone.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:04.140
I can't do that.

00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:08.270
Are you really all right?

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.240
Hey! Hang in there!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.230
Kitaro!

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:32.130
Dad!

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:37.090
Kitaro!

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:42.120
VAMPIRE TREE AND THE NOBIAGARI

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:46.620
KITARO AND BUBBLES

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:45.560
-<i>"I was sleeping."</i>
-<i>"Sorry."</i>

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:46.560
<i>"Smack!"</i>

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:56.420
Kitaro... Look what happened to you.

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:01.070
Look!

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:09.690
He's alive. Kitaro's alive!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:17.130
Hey, Kitaro sacrificed himself for me,
didn't he?

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:18.550
That's right.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:23.990
There's nothing there.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:34.340
I couldn't see anything, but it was there.
The Nobiagari.

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:38.340
Listen, Mana-chan...

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:42.610
Humans think their world is all there is.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:46.790
But what you see isn't everything.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.020
They're invisible, but there.

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:53.580
And there are some bad ones among them.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:57.000
They're drawn to the darkness
in people's hearts.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:58.880
Understand?

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:00.760
No, I don't.

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:02.260
But...

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:05.390
I want to.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:32.040
<i>"Mysterious trees appear
in Ikebukuro too!!!"</i>

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.100
Tell me...

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:37.500
Why do you and Kitaro help humans?

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:38.900
Well,

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:44.610
when Kitaro was a baby, a young man
named Mizuki helped him.

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:48.060
So it's a way of repaying the debt.

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:00.150
Kitaro!

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:04.800
Dad, sorry to worry you.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:08.660
No, I trusted you were all right.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:14.690
A lot of people were turned into Vampire
Trees while I couldn't move, right?

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:16.250
Yes, that's right.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.670
Let's go, Dad.

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:26.820
Don't you get it?
The Nobiagari is dangerous.

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.350
But, I want to go with you.

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:32.830
There must be something I can do!

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:40.070
Whatever.

00:17:40.190 --> 00:17:42.630
I won't save you again.

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:43.860
I know.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:50.870
It looks like construction's stopped
because of the Nobiagari.

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:52.700
Is the Nobiagari here?

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:54.770
No, it doesn't seem like it.

00:17:56.390 --> 00:17:57.080
It's back!

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:59.170
What? Static electricity?

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:04.460
It's called the Yokai Antenna. It stands
when Kitaro senses <i>yokai</i> activity.

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:05.840
Like a smartphone.

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:06.880
Hide!

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:24.780
I can see something!
Is that the Nobiagari?!

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:31.100
Mana-chan,
you've begun to believe in <i>yokai</i>.

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:34.100
That's why you're beginning to see them.

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:55.790
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:18:57.910 --> 00:18:58.830
Dammit!

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.130
Hair Needles!

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:17.750
Ouch!

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:19.770
Kitaro!

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:38.560
What coincidental power!

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:44.570
That's it!

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:14.010
Your greatest weapon
is your greatest weakness!

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:16.640
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.080
You won't get away!

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:29.130
It's the Nobiagari!

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:32.780
Get away from me!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.130
Hair Needles!

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:40.220
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:51.440
Finger Guns!

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:14.240
Now the people turned into Vampire Trees
should return to normal.

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:30.630
Kitaro, you did it!

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.940
I-I can't breathe.

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:36.740
You beat that huge thing all by yourself!

00:21:37.260 --> 00:21:41.640
It's not a matter of simply
beating or losing.

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:43.770
<i>Yokai</i> are...

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.370
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.370
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:08.750
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:08.750
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:11.420
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:11.420
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:16.430
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:16.430
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:19.300
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:19.300
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:23.890
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:23.890
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:24.850 --> 00:22:30.150
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:24.850 --> 00:22:30.150
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:30.270 --> 00:22:34.940
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:30.270 --> 00:22:34.940
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:35.070 --> 00:22:37.780
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:35.070 --> 00:22:37.780
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:40.910
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:40.910
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:43.540
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:43.540
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:48.460
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:48.460
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:51.500
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:51.500
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:54.250
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:54.250
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:56.720
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:56.720
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.840 --> 00:23:01.640
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.840 --> 00:23:01.640
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:05.930 --> 00:23:09.520
<i>Dad, 50,000 people suddenly disappeared,</i>

00:23:10.020 --> 00:23:12.690
<i>but it's not our concern, right?</i>

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:14.860
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:17.190
<i>"Terror! Miage-Nyudo"</i>

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:20.110
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
